{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "MyScoutee account affinity projections",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "Account-owned native projection writes and job-profile reads for affinity. Existing absolute/set/max Mongo operations are preserved; profile objects never cross as persistence handles. No automatic retries; unknown write outcomes remain failures and the existing caller job decides recovery. JobGroupContext active/inactive and base-group selection are carried explicitly; REAL/DEMO required. Restricted owner/affinity capability. 512 projection records per batch, 4096 identifiers per projection, 2 MiB requests, 16 MiB profile/ID replies and 16 KiB receipts. All client backfill batches are validated before the first write without buffering all payloads."
  },
